# Plumb the Forbidden: "you may sacrifice one or more creatures. When you do, copy this spell for each creature sacrificed
# this way." The sacrifice is optional: on turn 1 Bot1 casts it with an Ornithopter on the battlefield and chooses the
# way that sacrifices nothing (mode 1), so there is no copy: one card drawn, 19 life, the Ornithopter stays. On turn 3 it
# sacrifices that one creature (mode 2): one copy, so two cards are drawn and 2 life is lost (17).

[Bot1 Deck]
Swamp
Mox Jet
Ornithopter
Plumb the Forbidden
Plumb the Forbidden
Swamp
Swamp
Island x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x18

